# Frontend (React + Vite)

## API calls
- **Only** add HTTP calls in `frontend/src/services/api.js` using the shared `api` axios instance
- Base URL: `import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE_URL` (default `http://localhost:8000/api/v1`)

## Auth (JWT — required since June 2026)
- Register/login: `email` + `password` (min 8) → store `accessToken` in `localStorage` (`sakoon_token`)
- Axios interceptor: `Authorization: Bearer ${token}` on protected routes
- Session: `GET /auth/session` (no userId in URL) — see `docs/FRONTEND_BACKEND_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md` §7–11

## State
- User: `AppContext` + `sakoon_user` (`id`, `name`, `email`, `languagePreference`)
- Token: `sakoon_token` — clear on logout
- Session: `refreshSession()` → `getSession()` with Bearer
- Chat: `ChatProvider` needs `userId` + `sessionId` matching token user

## UX rules
- Chat: show loading/typing; responses can take 2–60s
- `isCrisis: true` → show `CrisisSupportPanel`; do not push exercises as primary CTA
- `isLimitReached` → block chat (`SessionLimitBanner`)

## Not wired yet (add via api.js)
- Assessment routes under `/assessment/*`
- Mood log/behavior under `/mood/*`
- See `docs/FRONTEND_BACKEND_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md` Section 11 for copy-paste helpers

## Errors
```javascript
const detail = err?.response?.data?.detail;
const msg = typeof detail === "string" ? detail : "Request failed";
```
